}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/workspace/members
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List Workspace Members

  Returns workspace users and all unaccepted invitations as one member-management list.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership. This read endpoint is available to owner, admin, and pharmacist roles.

  ## Request

  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Workspace members fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "members": [
        {
          "id": "user-uuid",
          "fullName": "Ada Owner",
          "email": "ada@example.com",
          "role": "owner",
          "status": "active",
          "isCurrentUser": true,
          "createdAt": "2026-01-10T09:00:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "user-uuid",
          "fullName": "John Pharmacist",
          "email": "john@example.com",
          "role": "pharmacist",
          "status": "suspended",
          "isCurrentUser": false,
          "suspendedAt": "2026-07-29T12:00:00.000Z",
          "createdAt": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "invitation-uuid",
          "inviteeName": "Jane Admin",
          "inviteeEmail": "jane@example.com",
          "role": "admin",
          "status": "pending",
          "isCurrentUser": false,
          "expiresAt": "2026-08-06T12:00:00.000Z",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-30T12:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Status Derivation

  | Row Type | Status Rule |
  |----------|-------------|
  | Membership | `suspended` when `suspendedAt` is non-null; otherwise `active`. |
  | Invitation | `expired` when `expiresAt` is in the past; otherwise `pending`. |

  ## Notes

  - Membership rows use `fullName` and `email`.
  - Invitation rows use `inviteeName` and `inviteeEmail`.
  - `isCurrentUser` is true only for the authenticated user's membership.
  - Accepted invitations are excluded because the resulting user membership is returned instead.
  - All rows are scoped to the authenticated workspace.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Membership or invitation retrieval failed unexpectedly. |
}
